# Judgment
Reject ("bad") if the edit:
- is empty, identical to the current clauses, or incoherent
- introduces task-specific constants, numbers, or per-sample hacks into the strategy layer
- contradicts existing well-supported clauses without justification
- is excessively long relative to its content

Otherwise accept ("good"). Output ONLY: good | bad, followed by a one-line reason.
